 "result": "Call order, with file paths (all under `src/tessel/`):\n\n1. `app.py:1021` `Tessel.finalize_request` builds the response with `make_response` (`app.py:1224`) and then calls `finalize_reply`.\n2. `app.py:1394` `Tessel.finalize_reply` runs the `after_request` functions. Then, unless the session is a null session, it calls `session_interface.persist_session(self, ctx._get_session(), response)` (`app.py:1416`).\n3. `sessions.py:337` `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session` does the cookie writing:\n   - It adds `Vary: Cookie` if the session was accessed.\n   - If the session is empty and was modified, it calls `response.delete_cookie`. If it is empty and unmodified, it returns without setting a cookie.\n   - It returns early if `cookie_needs_write` (`sessions.py:~234`) says no.\n   - Otherwise it computes `get_expiration_time` and signs the data with `make_signer(app).dumps(dict(session))`. Then it calls `response.set_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:374`).\n\nThe abstract `persist_session` is declared at `sessions.py:263`. `testing.py:177` also calls it directly for the test client.",
